{# The look every page shares (0268): the avonture.be design system (--mk-*), the meerkat (--mh-*), light
   and dark after the OS or the switch of the home page (`theme_choice.js.j2`, the same localStorage key),
   the fonts of /assets/ (OFL licences next to them: no page ever asks Google). The tokens, the colour
   names the pages had before (--bg, --card…) mapped onto them and the bar of `page_header.html.j2`
   are `assets/theme/tokens.css`, written once and shared with the reports (0273: they use the system
   fonts, a file cannot load these). Included by the home page and by every page served; `assets` is
   the /assets/ prefix. #}
{% set assets = header.assets if header is defined else paths.assets %}
@font-face {
  font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque";
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
  font-weight: 200 800;
  src: url("{{ assets }}fonts/bricolage-grotesque-latin-opsz-normal.woff2") format("woff2-variations");
}
@font-face {
  font-family: "Source Sans 3";
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
  font-weight: 200 900;
  src: url("{{ assets }}fonts/source-sans-3-latin-wght-normal.woff2") format("woff2-variations");
}
@font-face {
  font-family: "Source Sans 3";
  font-style: italic;
  font-display: swap;
  font-weight: 200 900;
  src: url("{{ assets }}fonts/source-sans-3-latin-wght-italic.woff2") format("woff2-variations");
}
@font-face {
  font-family: "JetBrains Mono";
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
  font-weight: 100 800;
  src: url("{{ assets }}fonts/jetbrains-mono-latin-wght-normal.woff2") format("woff2-variations");
}
{{ theme_tokens() }}
